<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">家庭设置</text>
      <text class="tag">V1</text>
    </view>
    <text class="subtle">先把家长真正会关心的信息放进来。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="setting-row">
      <text class="setting-label">我的昵称</text>
      <input class="setting-input" type="nickname" placeholder="点这里使用微信昵称" value="{{nickname}}" bindinput="handleNicknameInput" bindblur="handleNicknameBlur" maxlength="12" />
    </view>
    <view class="setting-row">
      <text class="setting-label">孩子昵称</text>
      <text class="setting-value">豆豆</text>
    </view>
    <view class="setting-row">
      <text class="setting-label">年级</text>
      <text class="setting-value">三年级</text>
    </view>
    <view class="setting-row">
      <text class="setting-label">默认奖励</text>
      <text class="setting-value">完成 +5 金币</text>
    </view>
    <view class="setting-row">
      <text class="setting-label">连续打卡</text>
      <text class="setting-value">3 天 +20 金币</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">产品判断</text>
    </view>
    <text class="subtle">这类产品真正难的不是页面，而是让家长愿意天天用。所以我优先做的是：录入快、排期清、奖励立刻能感知。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">学习统计</text>
    </view>
    <view class="empty-block" bindtap="goStats">
      <text class="tip-text">点我查看今日完成情况、金币和历史记录</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card sync-card">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">数据同步</text>
      <text class="sync-pill {{syncStatus.status}}">{{
        syncStatus.status === 'healthy' ? '已同步' :
        syncStatus.status === 'readonly' ? '只读' :
        syncStatus.status === 'error' ? '同步失败' : '未同步'
      }}</text>
    </view>

    <view class="sync-meta">
      <text class="sync-meta-line">上次同步：{{syncStatus.lastSyncDisplay}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{syncStatus.lastError}}" class="sync-meta-line err">{{syncStatus.lastError}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{syncStatus.readOnly}}" class="sync-meta-line warn">本机当前为只读，写操作不会保存到云端。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="sync-actions">
      <button wx:if="{{syncStatus.readOnly}}"
              class="sync-btn primary"
              loading="{{syncing}}"
              disabled="{{syncing}}"
              bindtap="handleReclaim">切回此设备</button>
      <button class="sync-btn {{syncStatus.readOnly ? 'ghost' : 'primary'}}"
              loading="{{syncing}}"
              disabled="{{syncing}}"
              bindtap="handleForceSync">立即同步</button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card section-card">
    <view class="section-header">
      <text class="section-title">下一步我建议</text>
    </view>
    <view class="empty-block">
      <text class="tip-text">1. 接 OCR 拍照识别\n2. 接云开发同步\n3. 做周报/月报\n4. 再决定社交要做多重</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>